<title>POLAND: Stalexport buys scrap metal firm.</title>
<headline>Stalexport buys scrap metal firm.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish steel trader Stalexport SA has bought a 60-percent share in scrap metal processor Centrozlom SA from the 15 National Investment Funds (NFI) for 9.2 million Zlotys ($2.6 million), NFI Zachodni's spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>NFI Zachodni had held 33 percent of Centrozlom.</p>
<p>Katarzyna Majchrzak said Stalexport had agreed to invest another five million zlotys over the next five years in Centrozlom which lost 0.2 million zlotys in this year's first quarter on 12.7 million zlotys in sales.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700 ($ = 3.516 Polish Zlotys)</p>
